<!--
  A11: the user-visible name is "Titlan" everywhere. Company and platform
  brand strings must not appear in any resource except the future About
  screen, whose resource names must be prefixed `about_`;
  scripts/check-invariants.sh enforces this.

  5e-1 (FLAG-2 discharged): EVERY user-visible string lives here; Kotlin
  carries no user-facing literal (scripts/check-invariants.sh family 20a).
  A value containing an apostrophe uses the double-quoted resource form so
  its wording stays byte-verbatim between the quotes (the plain-JVM
  CopyConventionTest strips exactly one enclosing quote pair). Frozen
  wording is marked as such and is never edited in place.
-->
